              "n": 2,
              "text": "<b>2</b>  only males have a Y chromosome / males are XY <b>or</b> females, do not have a Y chromosome / only have (two) X chromosomes <b>;  </b> <i> </i>",
              "numberedInMs": false
            },
            {
              "n": 3,
              "text": "<b>3</b>  <b>all</b>,<b> </b>sons / male offspring, of affected, males / fathers, have the disease <b>or </b> <b>all</b> sons will not have the disease if father does not have the disease <b>;  </b>",
              "numberedInMs": false
            }
          ]
        },
